From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] cryptxml: decode XML signatures, verify the SignedInfo

cryptxml: decode XML signatures, verify the SignedInfo

CryptXmlOpenToDecode parses the Signature elements of a document (xmllite,
DTDs prohibited) into the document context, signature and reference
structures, with the KeyName and RSA KeyValue of the KeyInfo. The context,
signature and reference handles answer CryptXmlGetDocContext,
CryptXmlGetSignature, CryptXmlGetReference and CryptXmlGetStatus.
CryptXmlVerifySignature canonicalizes SignedInfo (Canonical XML 1.0 or the
exclusive form) and verifies the signature value with bcrypt. New public
header cryptxml.h and a conformance test.
